00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:49.050
<v Michelle><lang pt-BR>Sim, comprei.</lang>

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:50.800
<v Orlando><lang pt-BR>Comprei</lang>, without any it.

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:53.050
<v José Luis><lang es>Y yo diría, sí, lo compré.</lang>

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:55.050
